1. MAIN OBJECTIVE

The application must allow an Operator or Head Teacher to create an account using either:

OPTION A — Google Account

Sign up / login using Google.

OPTION B — Phone Number

Sign up / login using a phone number and OTP verification.

The account must be permanently associated with the user's cloud profile.

The user's school-management data must belong to the ACCOUNT, not to the physical phone.

Therefore:

If an operator:

1. Creates an account on Phone A.
2. Adds schools, teachers, students, attendance and other records.
3. Loses Phone A.
4. Buys Phone B.
5. Installs the app.
6. Logs in using the SAME Google account or SAME verified phone number.

Then:

ALL authorised cloud data must automatically synchronize back to Phone B.

The user should not have to recreate the schools or re-enter students and teachers.

